工","id":"结晶动力学与加工"},{"level":2,"text":"物理态与材料选择","id":"物理态与材料选择"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"共聚与可控/活性自由基聚合（ATRP·RAFT）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/polymerization/copolymerization-controlled-radical"},"next":{"title":"力学与流变性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/structure-property/mechanical-rheological-properties"}}